1
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:09,576
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,856 --> 00:00:12,723
=Episode 28=

3
00:00:12,843 --> 00:00:15,603
(Kindness isn't weakness;
it leaves you a way out)

4
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:19,040
You betrayed the
late Empress's kindness,

5
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,920
and you let down

6
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:22,080
your father

7
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:23,800
(Imperial Study)
and His Majesty.

8
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:28,920
Your Majesty.

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:30,000
Your Majesty.

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,000
Your Majesty!

11
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,880
Before your father died,

12
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,560
he entrusted you to me.

13
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,200
I feared the rebel remnants
might come after you,

14
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,840
so I placed you
in the late Empress's care.

15
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,040
I thought,

16
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:46,760
before entering the palace,

17
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,120
you two were like sisters.

18
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,400
With her,

19
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:50,840
you'd be well cared for.

20
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,280
She'd look after you in every way.

21
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,600
And once you came of age,

22
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,520
(Imperial Study)
I would find you a good match.

23
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:00,280
No.

24
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:02,760
Your Majesty.

25
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,280
Was there truly

26
00:01:07,280 --> 00:01:09,280
never any love for me in your heart?

27
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,920
I treated you well

28
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:12,800
out of gratitude.

29
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,360
Your father stood by me all those years.

30
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,680
He died for my sake.

31
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:20,360
I knew you poisoned the late Empress

32
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:21,080
and harmed other consorts.

33
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,120
Yet I spared you.

34
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,960
Not for any other reason,

35
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,480
but because I gave your father my word.

36
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,920
No matter what you did,

37
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,400
I would keep you alive.

38
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,560
My word is my bond.

39
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,400
I kept my promises.

40
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:35,840
I indulged you time and again.
And what did you do?

41
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,120
You betrayed the late Empress.

42
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:42,080
You betrayed me.

43
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:46,240
And you betrayed your father's
deepest hopes for you.

44
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:52,440
I always thought

45
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:55,000
the late Empress kept me down

46
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,000
and wouldn't let me rise

47
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:00,000
because she feared I'd steal her favor.

48
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,320
I never thought

49
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:05,520
she was protecting me with her life.

50
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:09,040
I thought His Majesty loved me,

51
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,880
so I poisoned other consorts

52
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,480
and harmed the royal heirs,

53
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,880
all to keep his favor to myself

54
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:20,160
and become his wife.

55
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,200
But all along,

56
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,960
he was only repaying
my father's kindness.

57
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,040
(Imperial Study)
I thought my father died for nothing.

58
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,280
He gave his life

59
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,680
only for me to be a lowly maid.

60
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:39,880
I never expected that

61
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,480
my father had planned so far ahead.

62
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,200
He didn't want me to rise to power.

63
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,120
He didn't want wealth or glory for me.

64
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,200
All he wanted

65
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,760
was for me to leave the palace

66
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:56,040
and live an ordinary life,

67
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,440
safe and sound.

68
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,160
So...

69
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,800
in the end,

70
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:13,360
I was the only one who was wrong.

71
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:25,200
I was the only one who was wrong.

72
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:04,120
(Changsheng Gate)
His Majesty is leading the army himself.

73
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,600
Forward!

74
00:05:18,169 --> 00:05:20,076
(Changsheng Gate)

75
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,120
(In the spring of Year 22 of Yongqing,)

76
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,600
(His Majesty)

77
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,880
(led the army himself.)

78
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,760
(Before his departure,)

79
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:39,600
(he named the eldest prince
Crown Prince)

80
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,920
(to secure the succession.)

81
00:05:44,383 --> 00:05:46,500
(Emperor Yongqing's Tablet,
Honored for Upholding Heaven's Mandate)

82
00:05:46,500 --> 00:05:48,676
(and Establishing Order and Prosperity,
Renowned for His Virtue and Benevolence)

83
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:50,160
(Five years later,)

84
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,240
(The border war continued.)

85
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,360
(In the fall of Year 27 of Yongqing,)

86
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:56,680
(His Majesty)

87
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,440
(died in his military tent.)

88
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:07,240
Long live the Emperor!

89
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,840
(Now it's the first year of Hongqi.)

90
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:10,440
(The new Emperor
has ascended the throne.)

91
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,640
(Empress Fu is honored)

92
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:15,160
(as Empress Dowager.)

93
00:06:24,223 --> 00:06:26,603
(Six years later)

94
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,560
Chunli.

95
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,160
You've left the palace and married.

96
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,600
You're a Titled Lady now.

97
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,040
Why do you still come to the palace
so often?

98
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,600
If word gets around,

99
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,080
won't people laugh?

100
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,080
The moment I heard you were ill,

101
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:39,560
how could I sit still?

102
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:40,960
Even as a Titled Lady,

103
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,520
I had to come see that you're all right

104
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,720
before I could rest.

105
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,080
That's very kind of you.

106
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:49,960
Your Highness,

107
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,240
you're simply worn out,

108
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,520
lack of sleep has sapped your strength.

109
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,520
Nothing serious.

110
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,080
I'll write a prescription.

111
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,480
Take it on time and you'll recover.

112
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:01,320
Get more rest and worry less.

113
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:02,880
Chengyan,

114
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,560
thank you.

115
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,160
You've given your all these years,

116
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,200
always by my side.

117
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,320
I've burdened you.

118
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,200
More than given his all.

119
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,840
Director Li

120
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,480
has devoted himself tirelessly.

121
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,000
He's even put off getting married.

122
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:20,760
Your Highness,

123
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,920
please talk some sense into him.

124
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:23,640
It's time he settled down.

125
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:24,640
Indeed.

126
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:26,800
Director Li,

127
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,960
Her Highness often says

128
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:31,440
you've weathered every storm with her.

129
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,640
You're the one she trusts most.

130
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,480
Consort Rou is right.

131
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,920
You should start a family.

132
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,240
If there's someone you favor,

133
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,720
I myself

134
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,640
will decree the marriage.

135
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,640
All my life,

136
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,560
I've loved only one woman.

137
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,560
She is the woman I love most.

138
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,920
I once made her a promise.

139
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:23,960
I'd spend my whole life

140
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:25,920
keeping her safe.

141
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,320
I will never break my word.

142
00:08:58,436 --> 00:09:01,656
(Years later)

143
00:09:08,930 --> 00:09:13,676
(Fu Rong, Empress Dowager)

144
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:18,360
Long live the Empress Dowager!

145
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,400
Rise.

146
00:09:20,920 --> 00:09:21,720
Please, be seated.

147
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,720
Thank you, Your Highness.

148
00:09:29,683 --> 00:09:32,849
(Noble Consort Xian)

149
00:09:35,636 --> 00:09:38,836
(Consort Chun)

150
00:09:42,236 --> 00:09:44,689
(Lu Jiuning)

151
00:09:44,823 --> 00:09:47,383
(Song Wan'er)

152
00:09:47,530 --> 00:09:49,883
(Zhaoyi Yu)

153
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,880
I heard that

154
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:05,600
you've had trouble sleeping
and headaches lately.

155
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,160
So I sewed you a calming sachet,

156
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,240
wishing you peaceful sleep

157
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,440
and good health.

158
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,000
A sachet?

159
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,520
At the Dowager's birthday feast,

160
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:18,320
how could you give something so common?

161
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:19,960
Exactly.

162
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,240
The Empress Dowager worships Buddha.

163
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,680
She has every kind of incense.

164
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:25,000
And you bring her
such an ordinary thing.

165
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,600
Meiren Song is thoughtful.

166
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,880
You're pregnant.

167
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:05,960
Sit down.

168
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,000
Thank you, Your Highness.

169
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,000
From now on,

170
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,880
just take care of the baby.

171
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:17,600
For other matters,

172
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:19,000
leave them be.

173
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,600
Today,

174
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:32,400
I'd like to tell you a story.

175
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:35,560
When I was still a Cairen,

176
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:39,440
there was a Zhaoyi Shen.

177
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,560
She was beautiful,

178
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,440
but wildly ambitious.

179
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,360
She clung to the powerful

180
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:48,200
and harmed another's child.

181
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:52,520
Later, when her crimes were exposed,

182
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,440
with death staring her in the face,

183
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,200
she finally regretted her actions.

184
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,600
Her only worry

185
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,600
was her child.

186
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,560
She begged that after she was gone,

187
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,760
someone would shelter her child.

188
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:07,800
A mother's love for her child

189
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,400
is something

190
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,640
every woman can understand.

191
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,000
Any woman

192
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,640
would feel for her.

193
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,600
It's truly

194
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,040
tragic,

195
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,520
and heartbreaking.

196
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:24,440
In all my years governing the harem,

197
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:26,240
I've set one iron rule.

198
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:29,320
Life in the inner palace is
hard enough for women.

199
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,960
Young children

200
00:12:31,640 --> 00:12:34,480
should never become sacrifices
in these fights.

201
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:37,280
If anyone dares harm a royal heir,

202
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,880
I don't care

203
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,560
how powerful her family is

204
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,360
or how much favor she enjoys.

205
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:44,720
I will show her no mercy.

206
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,000
You're all still young.

207
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:49,840
You have a long road

208
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,960
ahead of you.

209
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,440
Remember one thing.

210
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,880
Here in the palace,

211
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:56,880
kindness

212
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,280
isn't weakness.

213
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:00,440
It leaves you a way out.

214
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,560
Today you protect another's child,

215
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:04,840
and one day,

216
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,640
someone will be there

217
00:13:07,160 --> 00:13:08,680
to protect your child.

218
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,240
A woman's life is never easy.

219
00:13:12,800 --> 00:13:14,960
We should support one another

220
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,120
and move forward together.

221
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:27,520
We will heed Your Highness's words.

222
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,640
You may all leave.

223
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,360
Yes.

224
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:55,840
All these years,

225
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:59,440
not a single child in the inner palace
has died needlessly.

226
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:01,760
And there have been no more

227
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:04,000
mysterious deaths among the harem.

228
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,280
The princesses have all grown up safely.

229
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:08,840
The princes

230
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,760
all study in peace.

231
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:14,320
If the late Emperor can see this,

232
00:14:14,800 --> 00:14:16,480
he must be deeply comforted.

233
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:20,240
Chengyan,

234
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,960
come take a walk with me.

235
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,240
Chengyan,

236
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,320
thank you.

237
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,520
You stood by me

238
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,000
through my darkest days,

239
00:14:53,560 --> 00:14:55,080
and stayed with me

240
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,800
to guard this hard-won peace.

241
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,000
I only kept

242
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,000
my own promise.

243
00:16:14,496 --> 00:16:18,616
(The end)

244
00:16:19,650 --> 00:16:24,130
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

245
00:16:24,570 --> 00:16:29,170
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

246
00:16:29,370 --> 00:16:33,970
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

247
00:16:34,210 --> 00:16:38,810
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

248
00:16:39,090 --> 00:16:43,570
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

249
00:16:44,010 --> 00:16:48,610
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

250
00:16:48,810 --> 00:16:53,410
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

251
00:16:53,770 --> 00:16:58,370
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

252
00:16:58,530 --> 00:17:03,130
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

253
00:17:03,410 --> 00:17:06,690
♪Let the stars and sea♪

254
00:17:06,690 --> 00:17:08,010
(Changsheng Gate)

255
00:17:08,010 --> 00:17:11,890
♪Wait for your return♪
